# Alternative .rest file format (if your extension prefers this)
@hostname = localhost
@port = 4005
@baseUrl = http://{{hostname}}:{{port}}
@bucket = test-bucket

### Quick Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health

### Quick File Upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/upload/file
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bucket"

{{bucket}}
--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="key"

quick-upload.txt
--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="quick.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Quick test upload!
--boundary123--

### Quick JSON Upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/upload/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "bucket": "{{bucket}}",
      "key": "quick-json.txt",
      "data": "UXVpY2sgSlNPTiB0ZXN0IHVwbG9hZCE="
    }
  ]
}
